{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Codelock is a game about an agent tasked with completing tasks inside a military base overrun by monsters. Armed with nothing but a gun and a faulty navigation system, you must manage your bullets wisely and maintain the power generators.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigation system that points you to a room of your choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gun with very limited bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiders that ambush from behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted posters that make spiders more active if you approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flesh walls that obnoxiously block your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal jammer enemies that redirect your navigation to certain doom</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Negative","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121410/9a49550779248d59ec27d7016c939b60e1a008e0.jpg"},{"name":"Really Negative","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121410/5b4d215c0efa695c4524dc78d8c4fe1d49e0b933.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121410/9a49550779248d59ec27d7016c939b60e1a008e0.jpg"},{"name":"Better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121410/9a49550779248d59ec27d7016c939b60e1a008e0.jpg"},{"name":"Now Try Impossible :)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121410/9a49550779248d59ec27d7016c939b60e1a008e0.jpg"},{"name":"Better Than The Developer",